		{
			description: [
				"Welcome to the circle of life for plants! With only hardy seeds, you can get wheat, but you'll need way more than that! Remember that linked plants can mutate into other plants, regardless of arrows! The arrows are only for progress, but given a single plant, you can grow anything using this!"
				""
				"To prove you know what you're doing, quests only take products of the crops, not the seeds themselves."
			]
